flowchart LR
    Human[Human operator] -->|password + MFA re-auth| KeyUI[Agent access-key management]
    KeyUI -->|one-time secret; hashed at rest| KeyStore[(API keys)]
    External[External automation / AI agent] -->|Bearer mcsm_pat_* over TLS| API[Control-plane API]
    API --> KeyPolicy[Expiry + revocation + route boundary]
    KeyPolicy --> Intersection[Server allowlist AND key scope AND live user RBAC]
    Intersection --> Operations[Existing audited server operations]
    Operations -->|internal node bearer token| Worker[Host worker agent]
    Operations --> Audit[(User + key audit attribution)]

